    { title: `Final velocity`, content: `$$v_x=10, v_y=15$$ $$v=\\sqrt{10^2+15^2}=\\sqrt{325}\\approx18.03\\text{ m/s}$$ Direction $$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{15}{10}=1.5 \\Rightarrow \\theta\\approx56.31^\\circ$$ north of east. Force changes direction of motion.` }
