    { title: `Final`, content: `$$v_E=6\\text{ m/s}$$ east unchanged $$v=\\sqrt{6^2+6^2}=6\\sqrt2\\approx8.49\\text{ m/s}$$ $$\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{6}{6}\\right)=45^\\circ$$ north of east. Force perpendicular changes direction, not speed along original much but increases speed magnitude.` }
