    { title: `Final`, content: `$$v=\\sqrt{10^2+10^2}=10\\sqrt2\\text{ m/s}$$ NE $45^\\circ$ Displacement $$\\sqrt{15^2+5^2}=\\sqrt{250}\\approx15.81\\text{ m}$$ Effect: sequential forces change direction and produce 2D motion.` }
