    { title: `Tension`, content: `For $2\\text{ kg}$: $$T-W_1=m_1 a$$ => $$T=20+2\\times2=24\\text{ N}$$ For $3\\text{ kg}$: $$W_2-T=m_2 a$$ => $$T=30-3\\times2=24\\text{ N}$$ matches.` }
