    { title: `Delta KE`, content: `$$\\Delta KE=W_{net}=60\\text{ J}$$ $$\\frac12\\times5\\times v_f^2=60$$ => $$v_f^2=24$$ => $$v_f\\approx4.899\\text{ m/s}$$ east.` }
