    { title: `Sign`, content: `$$\\theta<90^\\circ$$ $$\\cos\\theta>0$$ positive work, $$\\theta>90^\\circ$$ $$\\cos\\theta<0$$ negative work, $$\\theta=90^\\circ$$ $$\\cos\\theta=0$$ zero work.` },
    { title: `Unit and net`, content: `$$1\\text{ J}=1\\text{ N}\\cdot\\text{m}$$ $$W_{net}=\\sum W_i = F_{net}s\\cos\\theta_{net}$$` }
