    { title: `Speed`, content: `Falling from $3\\text{ m}$ to floor: $$\\frac12 mv^2 = mgh = 3\\text{ J}$$ => $$v=\\sqrt{2gh}=\\sqrt{60}\\approx7.746\\text{ m/s}$$ Same regardless of table intermediate, if table removed.` }
