    { title: `Variable example`, content: `If $$g$$ drops $10$ to $9$, average $9.5$, $$PE \\approx m \\bar{g} h = 2\\times9.5\\times5 = 95\\text{ J}$$ slightly less than $$100\\text{ J}$$ constant $10$ approximation. For small $h$ difference negligible.` }
