    { title: `g=5`, content: `$$PE=0.5\\times5\\times10=25\\text{ J}$$ $$v=\\sqrt{2\\times5\\times10}=\\sqrt{100}=10\\text{ m/s}$$ $$PE\\propto g$$, $$v\\propto\\sqrt{g}$$` }
