    { title: `Wnet`, content: `$$W_{net}=-80\\text{ J}$$ Friction $$20\\text{ N}$$ west $$4\\text{ m}$$ east $$W=-80\\text{ J}$$ matches. Friction is non-conservative, work depends on path length: longer path => more negative work, unlike gravity conservative path independent.` }
