    { title: `Work-energy`, content: `$$W_{nc}=\\Delta E_{mech}$$. If $$W_{nc}=0$$ (only conservative gravity, spring), $$E_{mech}$$ conserved: $$\\Delta PE = -\\Delta KE$$. If $$W_{nc}<0$$ (friction, air resistance), $$E_{mech}$$ decreases, energy dissipated to heat/sound.` }
